educed manufacturing footprint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2018 Q4","e":"gsk","d":"2019-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Simon Dingemans","x":"…for the revaluation of acquisition-related liabilities, principally the VECCL, were more than offset by a stronger operating performance, lower restructuring costs, lower asset impairment charges, and a favorable comparison with the charges taken in 2017 related to U.S. tax reform £0.7 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"Our free cash flow this quarter was in line with our expectations with GBP165 million, impacted, as you know, by the launch of generic Advair, the phasing of rebates, and higher restructuring charges, all as anticipated.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"…in the quarter were charges relating to intangibles resulting from the Tesaro acquisition, major restructuring focused on the supply chain representing non-cash charges relating to ramp up of the program we announced in July 2018, undervaluation of the embedded derivative in respect of GSK's…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2019-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"Nonetheless, it's a strong start to the year, and we reaffirm our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/01/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"I mean, just in terms of big picture principles, what GSK support is working toward addressing some of the real challenge in terms of patient out-of-pocket, why we are particularly supportive of rebate reform overall and being able to pass on -- pass through to patients some of the discounts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The main adjusting items in the quarter were major restructuring focused on the supply chain with also some initial charges for the integration of the consumer healthcare JV with Pfizer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"We're also moving forward with other divestments, which will continue through next year proceeds of which will help fund integration and restructuring activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Stephen Scala","x":"Two questions, the first is a follow-up on reform, but in GSK's 19-year history, this could be the first time, raised guidance twice in one year, let alone the first time in -- let alone in the first three quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q4","e":"gsk","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"And, we are building an efficient and effective model to deliver synergy targets and operating margin improvement with a particular focus on overlapping commercial infrastructure and also streamlining the supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2019 Q4","e":"gsk","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"Main adjusting items in the year were intangible amortization with higher charges as a result of the Tesaro acquisition, major restructuring focused on improving efficiency of the supply chain with also some initial charges for the integration of the Consumer Healthcare JV with Pfizer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"Gross adjusted operating margin this quarter was 29.4%, reflecting the strong sales growth across all three businesses, a more favorable mix in Vaccines and the continued benefits of restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Emma Walmsley","x":"And alongside streamlining our portfolio, proceeds from these divestments will also help fund cash costs to the integration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2020-07-29","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Luke Miels","x":"We're also doing DTC at point of sale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The main adjusting items in the quarter were major restructuring, which reflects continued progress in the Consumer Healthcare integration and separation preparation programs; transaction-related, within which the main contributor was a charge relating to remeasurement of the contingent…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"We're close to fulfilling our commitment to divest GBP one billion of noncore brands in order to refocus our portfolio as well as funding integration and restructuring activities within Consumer Healthcare.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2020-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"We're maintaining our full year guidance of adjusted EPS down 1% to 4%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2020-10-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Luke Miels","x":"We've been very successful in driving this recovery through our DTC campaign in conjunction with flu season.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dame Emma Walmsley","x":"Group adjusted operating margin for the quarter was 30.8% with the impact of vaccines more than offset by tight cost control and the realization of restructuring benefits with SG&A down 10% pro forma, while we've continued to invest in our pipeline and our new product launches.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The main adjusting items in the quarter I'd highlight are major restructuring, which reflects continued on-track progress on the Consumer Healthcare integration and transformation and separation activities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q4","e":"gsk","d":"2021-02-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Luke Miels","x":"We are addressing this very carefully targeted medical education programs and through DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q4","e":"gsk","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"In major restructuring, which reflect continued progress on the consumer healthcare integration and separation preparation programs, and in transaction related, within which the main contributor was a charge relating to remeasurement of the contingent consideration liability for ViiV Healthcare,…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2020 Q4","e":"gsk","d":"2021-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The pharma operating margin was 24.5% in 2020 and the 150 basis points decrease primarily reflected increased investments in the R&D pipeline and with the impact of lower revenues, largely offset by the continued benefit of restructuring and tight control of ongoing costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dame Emma Walmsley","x":"We also continue to streamline our pharma portfolio and this quarter we announced an agreement to divest our cephalosporin business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q1","e":"gsk","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The adjusted items of note for the quarter were in disposals, which largely reflected the profit on disposal of rights to the cabozantinib royalty stream and major restructuring, which reflected continued progress on the separation preparation programs and consumer healthcare integration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2021-07-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Dame Emma Walmsley","x":"With the implementing activities to drive this recovery with a comprehensive multi-channel DTC campaign and by focusing on relationships with US retailors, particularly as we focus on the flu vaccination season where adult vaccinations become increasingly top of mind for consumers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The positive operating leverage from higher sales in the quarter was bolstered by continued focus on cost control and the benefits of restructuring across the Group.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The increase in Q2 primarily reflected the positive operating leverage from the increased sales as well as continued tight cost control and restructuring benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q2","e":"gsk","d":"2021-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"I'll close with considerations for 2021 outlook, we're maintaining our full year guidance for adjusted EPS to decline mid to high single digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2021-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luke Miels","x":"And we're implementing activities to drive recovery with multi-channel direct-to-consumer campaigns, engaging healthcare providers, and further strengthening our relationships with U.S. retailers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian McNamara","x":"In the U.S., price increases were mid to high single-digits on brands that represent about 50% of our sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian McNamara","x":"And I'm confident, going forward, we have the ability to take price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The positive operating leverage from higher sales in the quarter was bolstered by continued focus on cost control and the benefits of restructuring across the group.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2021 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2021-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Mackay","x":"The increase in Q3 primarily reflects the positive operating leverage from increased sales, as well as continued tight cost control and restructuring benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/glaxosmithkline-plc-gsk-q2-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"GSK 2025 Q3","e":"gsk","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Julie Brown",